  "gsm8k": {
   "base": [
    " The ducks lay 16 * 7 = <<16*7=112>>112 eggs per week.\nSo, Janet eats 3 * 7 = <<3*7=21>>21 eggs for breakfast every day.\nShe also bakes muffins for her friends with 4 * 7 = <<4*7=28>>28 eggs.\nThus, Ja",
    " The robe takes 2 bolts of blue fiber and half that much white fiber, so it takes 2 + 2/2 = <<2+2/2=3>>3 bolts in total.\n#### 3",
    " The house increased in value by 80,000 * 1.5 = $<<80000*1.5=120000>>120,000.\nSo the house is now worth 80,000 + 120,000 = $<<80000+120000=200000>>200,000.\nThe profit is 200,000 - 80,000 - 50,000 = $<"
   ],
   "leak0": [
    " 16 - 1 = 15\nThe number of ducks is equal to the number of eggs laid by the ratio of the number of hens to the number of eggs laid by the hens, so 15/2 = 7.5\nThe number of hens is 15/2 - 1 = 7.5 - 1 =",
    " The answer is 1000/2 = 5000 people were working at the same rate, so 1000 x 1 = 1000 people were working in 1 hour. 100 people would have taken 24 hours to complete the task so 100 x 12 = 1200 people",
    " 120% of the original price is the profit from the first job he did.  The first job he did was 100% of the original price of the house so the value of the house was reduced by 100-10% of the original "
   ],
   "leak0_dom": [
